###  Commits on Nov 12, 2019 

  * ####  [ Renamed the varint functions and added signed versions. ](/jkbonfield/htscodecs/commit/363f48a2f6d680cc8c9c51c5578684ab3a93d46d "Renamed the varint functions and added signed versions.

We now have var_{put,get}_{s,u}{32,64} as the naming scheme.
Hence u7tou32 becomes var_get_u32 and u32tou7 becomes var_put_u32.

The 64-bit ones are just a change of parameter type; the on disk
format is identical and 64-bit encodings < 32-bit in size will
match the 32-bit functions.")

